WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.567
-Welcome, welcome, welcome.
Enjoy yourself.

00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:04.634
Welcome to "The Tonight Show."
Happy Halloween!

00:00:04.634 --> 00:00:07.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.267 --> 00:00:09.133
I love Halloween.
It's that special day

00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:11.334
that we tell our kids
to eat tons of sugar,

00:00:11.334 --> 00:00:13.934
knock on strangers' doors,
and lie about who they are.

00:00:13.934 --> 00:00:15.334
It's just --
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:17.801
It's just good parenting,
really.

00:00:17.801 --> 00:00:19.534
Yep.
Halloween is a magical night

00:00:19.534 --> 00:00:21.834
where we all pretend
to be someone we're not,

00:00:21.834 --> 00:00:24.501
or as it's also known,
posting on Instagram.

00:00:24.501 --> 00:00:26.834
And Halloween is interesting

00:00:26.834 --> 00:00:28.634
because it turns every family
into the Mafia.

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:32.033
Kids come home with candy and
have to kick up 10% to the boss.

00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:35.167
It's like, "All right.
A fun-size Snickers, all right?

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:37.133
Just wet my beak."

00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:40.400
'Course, a lot of people
have the same costume idea.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:41.667
It'll look less like Halloween

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:43.267
and more like the running
of the Barbies today.

00:00:43.267 --> 00:00:44.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.868 --> 00:00:47.167
I read that some towns
have laws

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:49.567
that ban older kids
from trick-or-treating.

00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:52.100
-Aww.
[ Audience groans ]

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:53.434
I get a little skeptical
when a kid's like,

00:00:53.434 --> 00:00:54.667
[ Imitates smoking, deep voice ]
No, Tootsie Rolls.

00:00:54.667 --> 00:00:56.868
They're hell on my bridge work.

00:00:56.868 --> 00:00:59.400
Tough on my bridge."

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:00.901
[ Normal voice ] Speaking of
candy, I saw a poll

00:01:00.901 --> 00:01:03.968
that said 51% of people say
Reese's Peanut Butter Cups

00:01:03.968 --> 00:01:06.267
are the best Halloween candy.
-Yes.

00:01:06.267 --> 00:01:10.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:12.167
They actually released
a lot of interesting data

00:01:12.167 --> 00:01:13.334
about the holiday.
Check this out.

00:01:13.334 --> 00:01:15.000
First up, when asked,
"What are your plans

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.200
for trick-or-treating?

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.701
30% of people
said, "Getting dressed up,"

00:01:18.701 --> 00:01:20.667
20% said, "Handing out candy,"

00:01:20.667 --> 00:01:22.767
50% said, "Turning off
all the lights in my house

00:01:22.767 --> 00:01:25.067
and watching an iPad
under a thick blanket."

00:01:25.067 --> 00:01:27.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:27.734 --> 00:01:31.067
-Ding-dong!

00:01:31.067 --> 00:01:32.067
-"Lower the volume,
lower the volume,

00:01:32.067 --> 00:01:34.033
lower the volume!"
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.033 --> 00:01:35.968
Here's another one.
When asked, "What's a quote

00:01:35.968 --> 00:01:38.367
that strikes fear
into your heart?"

00:01:38.367 --> 00:01:41.267
60% said, "I see dead people."

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:44.434
30% said, "Whatever you do,
don't fall asleep."

00:01:44.434 --> 00:01:47.000
10% said, "We have information
about your car's

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:48.133
extended warranty."

00:01:48.133 --> 00:01:52.701
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:01:52.701 --> 00:01:54.901
Up next, when asked,
"How old is too old

00:01:54.901 --> 00:01:56.300
to go trick-or-treating?"

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:59.801
40% said, "14 years old."
Interesting.

00:01:59.801 --> 00:02:02.400
40% said, "16 years old."

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:04.534
20% said, "If you know the sound

00:02:04.534 --> 00:02:06.667
AOL used to make
when you logged on."

00:02:06.667 --> 00:02:08.334
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:08.334 --> 00:02:12.601
-Bee ckkkk!
Be-yoo!

00:02:12.601 --> 00:02:14.467
-You've got mail.

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:16.567
-Oh, cool!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.567 --> 00:02:19.667
Next one asks, "What's the best
couples costume?"

00:02:19.667 --> 00:02:22.100
25% said, "Taylor and Travis."

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:24.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:24.501 --> 00:02:26.801
25% said, "Tatum and Kravitz,"

00:02:26.801 --> 00:02:28.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.167 --> 00:02:30.200
50% said,
"Boebert and Grab-It's."

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:31.033
Hey, wait, wait, wait.

00:02:31.033 --> 00:02:32.067
-Ayy!
-What?

00:02:32.067 --> 00:02:33.968
-What?!

00:02:33.968 --> 00:02:35.200
♪♪

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:37.133
Grab it.

00:02:37.133 --> 00:02:39.133
-Finally, when asked,
"what's the next closest thing

00:02:39.133 --> 00:02:40.501
to a haunted house?"

00:02:40.501 --> 00:02:42.667
20% said,
"Spirit Halloween tomorrow."

00:02:42.667 --> 00:02:43.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.901 --> 00:02:46.767
30% said, "Rite Aid today,"

00:02:46.767 --> 00:02:48.267
and 50% said, "Mike Pence's

00:02:48.267 --> 00:02:49.334
campaign headquarters
next week."

00:02:49.334 --> 00:02:50.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.434 --> 00:02:52.367
Very important.
Interesting poll.

00:02:52.367 --> 00:02:55.400
-Wow.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:57.033
-Well, this is fun.
Last night at the White House,

00:02:57.033 --> 00:02:58.567
President Biden
and the First lady

00:02:58.567 --> 00:03:02.434
handed out books and candy
to trick-or-treaters.

00:03:02.434 --> 00:03:04.601
Books.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.601 --> 00:03:06.000
Some kids are like,
"I got a Twix,"

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.834
while others are like,
"I got '50 Shades of Grey.'

00:03:07.834 --> 00:03:10.400
What?
What's going on?"

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:11.534
You guys see this?

00:03:11.534 --> 00:03:13.467
Yesterday, Florida Governor
Ron DeSantis

00:03:13.467 --> 00:03:17.100
