00:03:24.767 --> 00:03:25.968
"Can't.
Nothing we can..."

00:03:25.968 --> 00:03:31.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:34.467
DeSantis claims that he's 5'11",
which is a lie

00:03:34.467 --> 00:03:37.033
