5'11", he'd say he's 6'.

00:03:37.033 --> 00:03:39.067
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.067 --> 00:03:42.300
Some business news -- Walmart
just unveiled over 100 stores

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:44.834
