00:10:09.868 --> 00:10:12.000
[ Laughter ]

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.434
Not bad, not bad.

00:10:14.434 --> 00:10:18.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:10:18.434 --> 00:10:19.734
-Wow.

00:10:19.734 --> 00:10:21.133
-I feel good about this.
-Sitting ovation.

00:10:21.133 --> 00:10:23.267
-If we win, do we get
a standing ovation?

00:10:23.267 --> 00:10:24.501
Let's see the results.

00:10:25.567 --> 00:10:27.801
Booyah! Come on, get up!
[ Dinging ]

00:10:27.801 --> 00:10:29.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:10:29.567 --> 00:10:35.267
♪♪

00:10:35.267 --> 00:10:37.634
Oh!

00:10:37.634 --> 00:10:38.834
Guys, you nailed it.

00:10:38.834 --> 00:10:41.000
Looks like the winner
is mannequin right there.

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:42.601
I'm going to post this
during the break.

00:10:42.601 --> 00:10:45.501
If you happen to see it online,
give that WePost a repost.

00:10:45.501 --> 00:10:46.968
We have a great show.

